The full notice is in mineai/LICENSE-mine-ai-mcp. This patch (a change for Muse plays Minecraft, picasso-lab) is
applied to the pinned commit by mineai/fetch-and-patch.sh (or scripts/mineai-fetch.mjs); git apply skips these lines.
0007: a placed block (a temporary crafting table or furnace, a bed, a place_block) never goes into a cell the server
will not replace: flowers and tulips are out of the replaceable set (vanilla's and Paper's replaceable tag has none of
them), and snow counts only as a single layer. Staging, spot 7: the temporary table was put on a poppy, the server
refused it ("block ... is still poppy") and the craft failed in 81 ms. With tests (block-classification, nearby-placement).

